---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import Prose from '../components/Prose.astro';
---

<Base title="Privacy Policy" description="How this website handles your data.">
  <PageHero eyebrow="Legal" title="Privacy policy" />

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 py-16">
    <Prose>
      <h2>Hosting</h2>
      <p>
        This website is a static site hosted on <a href="https://docs.github.com/en/pages">GitHub Pages</a> (GitHub,
        Inc.). When you visit, GitHub's servers automatically receive technical information such as your IP address,
        browser and device type, and the time of your request. GitHub processes this data to deliver the site securely;
        see the <a href="https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement">GitHub Privacy Statement</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>Cookies and analytics</h2>
      <p>
        This site sets <strong>no cookies</strong> and uses <strong>no analytics or tracking</strong>. Fonts are served
        from this site itself, so no font data is sent to third parties.
      </p>

      <h2>Newsletter</h2>
      <p>
        If you choose to subscribe to our newsletter, your details are stored with <a href="https://mailchimp.com/legal/privacy/">Mailchimp</a>,
        the service we use to send it. We use this information only for the newsletter, and you can unsubscribe at any
        time using the link in every email.
      </p>

      <h2>External links</h2>
      <p>
        Our pages link to external services (for example WhatsApp and the Mailchimp signup form). When you follow those
        links, the respective provider's own privacy policy applies.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        For any questions about your data, write to <a href="mailto:info@ea-aachen.org">info@ea-aachen.org</a>.
      </p>
    </Prose>
  </section>
</Base>
